# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The default path is FREE and needs NO keys. `npm run render` works as-is, and
# Claude Code writes/patches props.json in-session for $0. Everything below is
# OPTIONAL and only unlocks extra capability.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Free stock b-roll (photos + video). Free keys, commercial use, no attribution.
#   Pexels:  https://www.pexels.com/api/
#   Pixabay: https://pixabay.com/api/docs/
# PEXELS_API_KEY=
# PIXABAY_API_KEY=

# Whisper caption model/version (default: base.en / 1.5.5). large-v3-turbo = best.
# WHISPER_MODEL=large-v3-turbo
# WHISPER_VERSION=1.7.1

# Kokoro voiceover model override (default is fine).
# KOKORO_MODEL=onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX

# ── OPTIONAL PAID upgrades (off by default) ──────────────────────────────────
# Anthropic — the OPTIONAL `npm run generate` brief→spec path. Not needed: the
# primary path is Claude Code writing props.json in-session.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# AI image/video generation (scripts/lib/genvideo.ts): fal.ai (FLUX.2 / Veo / Kling)
# or Replicate. Fills scenes that set backgroundMedia.prompt.
# FAL_KEY=
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=
# REPLICATE_MODEL=

# Premium/commercial voiceover (ElevenLabs). Note: the free tier is non-commercial
# and requires attribution — leave off unless you have a paid plan.
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
